.IX Title "Pedigree::PersonNode 3"
.TH Pedigree::PersonNode 3 "2021-10-02" "perl v5.18.4" "User Contributed Perl Documentation"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
